==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Baron Face]] spawns as the boss after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*4 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 28.33 seconds<sup>850f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage immediately swarms you with everything it has, so you should do the same. Build up [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]], [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]], [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Gold Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] on the Shy Boy and get ready for an all-out brawl. [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] will suffice in the meatshielding department, but be sure to bring [[Gold Silver Strike (Combo)|Gold Silver Strike]] for Surge Immunity, since Condemned Pengs will be abhorrent to deal with otherwise. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] is also a great counter to I.M. Phace.

